{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14965","headline":"九日同司直九叔崔侍御登宝鸡南楼 · 卢纶","name":"九日同司直九叔崔侍御登宝鸡南楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"把菊叹将老，上楼悲未还。\n短长新白发，重叠旧青山。\n霜气清衿袖，琴声引醉颜。\n竹林唯七友，何幸亦登攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}